comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-06T05:48:07.109Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-09-06: strict complete all-status export of 2649 items found no GH-1207 owner. Request-specific search and open/in-progress reads were checked. Full live pm-larv4r metadata and verified history confirm its completed finding-severity scope. This new report arrived during PR 1208 review and is recorded open and unclaimed."
body: "External report: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1207\n\nExisting findings and failed_because contracts from pm-larv4r are shipped and must be reused. This item owns the remaining boolean/strictness authority boundary, not the already completed self-indexing work."
